              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The card stays in the panel (owner, 2026-10-21) but exists only once a term is selected. Until then the log is plain: no [n] marks, no card, no highlighted chip. Terms heard still collect in the footer, and clicking a chip selects that term's latest line.",
