              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Proposed, not decided: Default inserts the card under its line when it appears, pushing later lines down (no sideways reflow). Wide keeps the margin column reserved with a quiet hint, so the log measure never changes when the first footnote lands.",
