              "content": "The panel from Proposal 4 through a call. Speakers are now words in the gutter: «я» is the mic track in teal, «они» the call track in amber (mvp.md rule 2). Start and stop sit in the header. Unconfirmed text is dim and is replaced in place when confirmed text arrives. A selection is anchored to its words, so appends below never move or drop it. ⌃⌥⌘E sends the selection to bb and the card reports each step.",
