              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Opened from Стоп or the calls list. While the final pass runs, the live text is shown and labelled as such; the final transcript replaces it when done (raw text is never overwritten: a new file is written beside it). A failed pass keeps the live text and offers Retry while audio exists. When done, the summary lives in a bb thread and the header links to it.",
