              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "One page, label column on the left. Data folder; the final-pass engine (required, so there is no empty choice); audio cleanup, stated rather than set (7 days, pin to keep); the explain hotkey. Chunk size appears only in debug builds, under a DEBUG mark; release builds use 4 s.",
