              "fontWeight": "600",
              "letterSpacing": -1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Go3wj",
              "name": "Idea",
              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Changed from Screen 3 after review (inventory-59, owner 2026-10-21): the terms row is gone (auto-detected term chips are Later in mvp.md; see «Later — term chips»). Live text is as messy as the spike's Parakeet output: OKR comes out «ОКР», SLA «слог», and words repeat at chunk edges. The card gains a fallback that stops at «sent», with a link to the bb thread.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "MCGL4",
              "name": "Open",
              "fill": "#B4540A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Proposed, not decided: no hotkey for start/stop; the 4 s steps follow the default chunk size. Depends on bb's CLI: the «done» card shows the answer only if the app can read it back; `bb thread spawn` is only known to create a thread, so without a read-back the card stops at «sent, no read-back». RACI was never spoken in the spike, so its spelling here is a guess.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "UYuMv",
